  "description": "Kim Yongsoo and his friend Na Haesung entered the college successfully. Right now, they are looking for a place to live. Mr. Kim proposed to rent a room in the house of his cousin, Mr. Jeong Lee. Mr. Haesung fails to befriend Mr. Lee, as he ignores him. What secrets does he keep and why Haesung can't stop thinking about him?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/in_rose_garden), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020009913), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000055418), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230284), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/none?ind=1768)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://honeytoon.com/comic/the-strange-neighbors)",
